From: Sang Ngo <sang.ngo.yf@renesas.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Oct 2024 13:54:58 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Fix issue: can not get regulator mali on scarthgap

Signed-off-by: Sang Ngo <sang.ngo.yf@renesas.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/arm/midgard/mali_kbase_core_linux.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/arm/midgard/mali_kbase_core_linux.c b/drivers/gpu/arm/midgard/mali_kbase_core_linux.c
index 7b83103..5dee915 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/arm/midgard/mali_kbase_core_linux.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/arm/midgard/mali_kbase_core_linux.c
@@ -4440,7 +4440,7 @@ int power_control_init(struct kbase_device *kbdev)
 	int err = 0;
 	unsigned int i;
 #if defined(CONFIG_REGULATOR)
-	static const char *const regulator_names[] = { "mali" };
+	static const char *const regulator_names[] = { "mali", NULL };
 #endif /* CONFIG_REGULATOR */
 
 	if (!kbdev)
